# No console

## Requirement

`console.log`, `console.error`, `console.warn`, `console.debug` are **forbidden** in application code.

## Alternatives

- **Backend (api, worker, shared):** Use `createLogger(label)` from `@seller/shared` — see [logging-winston.mdc](.cursor/rules/logging-winston.mdc)
- **Frontend (web):** Remove debug logs; for user-facing errors use toasts, error boundaries, or UI state

## Enforcement

- ESLint rule `no-console: error` applies to all `.ts` and `.tsx` files
- Do not add `eslint-disable-next-line no-console` — fix the code instead
